{"id": "general-code-001", "suite": "general", "category": "general/code", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Write a Python function `is_even(n)` that returns True if n is even and False otherwise. Reply with the code in a Python code block."}], "tool_names": [], "check": {"type": "python_code", "func": "is_even", "n_params": 1}, "oracle": "```python\ndef is_even(n):\n    return n % 2 == 0\n```", "source": "handwritten"}
{"id": "general-code-002", "suite": "general", "category": "general/code", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Write a Python function `add(a, b)` that returns the sum of two numbers. Reply with the code in a Python code block."}], "tool_names": [], "check": {"type": "python_code", "func": "add", "n_params": 2}, "oracle": "```python\ndef add(a, b):\n    return a + b\n```", "source": "handwritten"}
{"id": "general-code-003", "suite": "general", "category": "general/code", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Write a Python function `reverse_string(s)` that returns the string reversed. Reply with the code in a Python code block."}], "tool_names": [], "check": {"type": "python_code", "func": "reverse_string", "n_params": 1}, "oracle": "```python\ndef reverse_string(s):\n    return s[::-1]\n```", "source": "handwritten"}
{"id": "general-code-004", "suite": "general", "category": "general/code", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Write a Python function `factorial(n)` that returns n! for a non-negative integer n. Reply with the code in a Python code block."}], "tool_names": [], "check": {"type": "python_code", "func": "factorial", "n_params": 1}, "oracle": "```python\ndef factorial(n):\n    result = 1\n    for i in range(2, n + 1):\n        result *= i\n    return result\n```", "source": "handwritten"}
{"id": "general-code-005", "suite": "general", "category": "general/code", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Write a Python function `count_vowels(text)` that returns how many vowels (a, e, i, o, u) a string contains. Reply with the code in a Python code block."}], "tool_names": [], "check": {"type": "python_code", "func": "count_vowels", "n_params": 1}, "oracle": "```python\ndef count_vowels(text):\n    return sum(1 for c in text.lower() if c in 'aeiou')\n```", "source": "handwritten"}
{"id": "general-code-006", "suite": "general", "category": "general/code", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Write a Python function `max_of_list(items)` that returns the largest item without using the built-in max. Reply with the code in a Python code block."}], "tool_names": [], "check": {"type": "python_code", "func": "max_of_list", "n_params": 1}, "oracle": "```python\ndef max_of_list(items):\n    best = items[0]\n    for x in items[1:]:\n        if x > best:\n            best = x\n    return best\n```", "source": "handwritten"}
{"id": "general-code-007", "suite": "general", "category": "general/code", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Write a Python function `is_palindrome(s)` that checks whether a string reads the same forwards and backwards, ignoring case. Reply with the code in a Python code block."}], "tool_names": [], "check": {"type": "python_code", "func": "is_palindrome", "n_params": 1}, "oracle": "```python\ndef is_palindrome(s):\n    t = s.lower()\n    return t == t[::-1]\n```", "source": "handwritten"}
{"id": "general-code-008", "suite": "general", "category": "general/code", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Write a Python function `fizzbuzz(n)` that returns the FizzBuzz string for a number n. Reply with the code in a Python code block."}], "tool_names": [], "check": {"type": "python_code", "func": "fizzbuzz", "n_params": 1}, "oracle": "```python\ndef fizzbuzz(n):\n    if n % 15 == 0:\n        return 'FizzBuzz'\n    if n % 3 == 0:\n        return 'Fizz'\n    if n % 5 == 0:\n        return 'Buzz'\n    return str(n)\n```", "source": "handwritten"}
{"id": "general-code-009", "suite": "general", "category": "general/code", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Write a Python function `celsius_to_fahrenheit(c)` that converts degrees Celsius to Fahrenheit. Reply with the code in a Python code block."}], "tool_names": [], "check": {"type": "python_code", "func": "celsius_to_fahrenheit", "n_params": 1}, "oracle": "```python\ndef celsius_to_fahrenheit(c):\n    return c * 9 / 5 + 32\n```", "source": "handwritten"}
{"id": "general-code-010", "suite": "general", "category": "general/code", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Write a Python function `unique(items)` that removes duplicates from a list but keeps the original order. Reply with the code in a Python code block."}], "tool_names": [], "check": {"type": "python_code", "func": "unique", "n_params": 1}, "oracle": "```python\ndef unique(items):\n    seen = set()\n    out = []\n    for x in items:\n        if x not in seen:\n            seen.add(x)\n            out.append(x)\n    return out\n```", "source": "handwritten"}
{"id": "general-code-011", "suite": "general", "category": "general/code", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Write a Python function `word_count(text)` that returns the number of words in a string. Reply with the code in a Python code block."}], "tool_names": [], "check": {"type": "python_code", "func": "word_count", "n_params": 1}, "oracle": "```python\ndef word_count(text):\n    return len(text.split())\n```", "source": "handwritten"}
{"id": "general-code-012", "suite": "general", "category": "general/code", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Write a Python function `fibonacci(n)` that returns the n-th Fibonacci number, with fibonacci(0) = 0 and fibonacci(1) = 1. Reply with the code in a Python code block."}], "tool_names": [], "check": {"type": "python_code", "func": "fibonacci", "n_params": 1}, "oracle": "```python\ndef fibonacci(n):\n    a, b = 0, 1\n    for _ in range(n):\n        a, b = b, a + b\n    return a\n```", "source": "handwritten"}
